Mifal vendors skills, guidance and code from the projects below. Each keeps its own
licence; the full texts are in third_party/licenses/ and in
skills/frontend-design/references/interface/licenses/. The exact upstream
commit, folder tree and the files Mifal changed for every vendored skill are
recorded in third_party/provenance.json.

- Matt Pocock's skills (github.com/mattpocock/skills): 28 skills. MIT,
  Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock.
- DDD (github.com/romiluz13/ddd): ddd, ddd-scope, ddd-ground, ddd-verify. MIT,
  Copyright (c) 2026 DDD Methodology.
- Superpowers (github.com/obra/superpowers): receiving-code-review,
  verification-before-completion. MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 Jesse Vincent.
- agent-browser (github.com/vercel-labs/agent-browser): the agent-browser
  skill. Apache-2.0, Copyright 2025 Vercel Inc.
- Anthropic skills (github.com/anthropics/skills): the base of frontend-design.
  Apache-2.0; no copyright owner is stated upstream.
- Herdr (github.com/herdrdev/herdr): the herdr skill. Apache-2.0; no copyright
  owner is stated upstream. Herdr itself is installed separately and is not
  part of this repository.
- Impeccable 4.5.0 (github.com/pbakaus/impeccable): guidance adapted into
  frontend-design's interface appendix. Apache-2.0, copyright Paul Bakaus and
  contributors. Its upstream NOTICE.md is kept in third_party/licenses/.
- LottieFiles motion-design 1.0.0 (github.com/LottieFiles/motion-design-skill):
  guidance adapted into the same appendix. MIT, Copyright (c) 2025 LottieFiles.
- tomli 2.4.1 (github.com/hukkin/tomli): the TOML parser the engine reads a Codex
  Home's config.toml with, unmodified. MIT, Copyright (c) 2021 Taneli Hukkinen.

Changes Mifal made to vendored skills: a self-improvement section appended to
each SKILL.md; invocation blockers removed so every skill is model-invoked;
agents/openai.yaml interface metadata added; frontend-design extended with a
local interface appendix. Apache-2.0 files Mifal changed say so at their end.
